  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Jobs for Youth in Resilient Agrifood System in Nigeria, Sierra Leone and Liberia(&#x2018;26-&apos;30/USD14M)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More young women and men in Nigeria, Sierra Leone and Liberia have access to skills building and green employment opportunities in agrifood systems.&#xb18d;&#xc2dd;&#xd488; &#xbd84;&#xc57c; &#xb179;&#xc0c9; &#xace0;&#xc6a9; &#xbc0f; &#xcc3d;&#xc5c5; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xd655;&#xb300;, &#xb18d;&#xc2dd;&#xd488; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xb0b4; &#xb179;&#xc0c9; &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcd09;&#xc9c4; &#xc5ec;&#xac74; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the creation of an enabling environment for young men and women in the three countries to expand digitalization, financial inclusion, market access, and green job opportunities in the agrifood sector, and providing skills and employment opportunities to young rural men and women</narrative>
  </description>
